      "id": 1,
      "text": "Corry’s name came from a railroad ticket office that mistakenly spelled Hiram Cory’s name, turning the intended “Cory” into “Corry.”.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
