      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Corry%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 2022, Downtown Corry earned a spot on the National Register of Historic Places, preserving its classic architecture.",
